# Bonds That Never Die (crystalWar 45) at Rholont: available (649 / 651), accepted (651), completed (Songbirds in a
# Snowstorm and Claws only) against the Claws rival. Rholont beside Claws of the Griffon (available: Gifts of the
# Griffon completed, a GM; its 47 is a Progress reply and the quest-specific replies below tie or beat it; a tie
# takes container order the first time, and the rotation var is written only once two or more replies tie, so a
# later tie plays the next reply) and Songbirds in a Snowstorm (a Lua quest). A level 99 Warrior in Southern San
# d'Oria [S]. Each state is set by GMs; after a talk Claws is set back to available (a GM) so it stays a rival;
# every talk is followed by its finish.
lists SouthernSanDoriaS/Rholont/onTrigger SouthernSanDoriaS/Rongelouts_N_Distaud/onTrigger
