# Rongelouts N Distaud (Bonds' 650 / 654, Progress replies) against Chasing Shadows (a Lua quest, group 8: available
# once Blood of Heroes is completed, its Rongelouts reply the Progress 165; accepted, the Event 168).
warp 1.5,1.999,-22.006 SouthernSanDoriaS
quest CrystalWar.BloodOfHeroes completed # a GM: Chasing Shadows available
quest CrystalWar.BondsThatNeverDie completed # a GM
charvar Quest[7][45]Option 1 # a GM
trigger Rongelouts_N_Distaud # Bonds' 654 and Chasing's 165 tie (Progress): container order, Chasing first
finish # Chasing Shadows begun
trigger Rongelouts_N_Distaud # Chasing's 168 (an Event) loses to Bonds' 654 (Progress)
finish # Bonds' Option 0
quest CrystalWar.BondsThatNeverDie available # a GM
quest CrystalWar.BondsThatNeverDie accepted # a GM
charvar Quest[7][45]Prog 5 # a GM
trigger Rongelouts_N_Distaud # Bonds' 650 (Progress) beats Chasing's 168 (accepted, an Event)
finish # Bonds completed
